<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="uk">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>KCL2 MAP Ukraine | Онлайн карта тривог</title>
    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        body {
            background-color: #0b0f19;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 15px;
        }
        header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 24px;
            color: #38bdf8;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
        .subtitle {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #94a3b8;
            margin-top: 4px;
        }
        .container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 650px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 15px;
        }
        .map-card {
            background-color: #1e293b;
            border-radius: 16px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
            border: 1px solid #334155;
            position: relative;
        }
        .map-card img {
            width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            display: block;
            min-height: 250px;
            background-color: #0f172a;
        }
        .info-bar {
            padding: 12px 15px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #cbd5e1;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            background-color: #172033;
            border-top: 1px solid #334155;
        }
        .status-dot {
            display: inline-block;
            width: 8px;
            height: 8px;
            background-color: #22c55e;
            border-radius: 50%;
            margin-right: 6px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 8px #22c55e;
        }
        .btn-refresh {
            background-color: #38bdf8;
            color: #0f172a;
            border: none;
            padding: 6px 12px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 12px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .radar-panel {
            background-color: #1e293b;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 15px;
            border: 1px solid #334155;
        }
        .radar-title {
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #f43f5e;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .radar-list {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #94a3b8;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        footer {
            margin-top: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #64748b;
            text-align: center;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>🇺🇦 KCL2 MAP UKRAINE</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Моніторинг повітряних тривог онлайн 24/7</p>
    </header>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="map-card">
            <img id="alertMap" src="https://ubstatic.com/map/map.png" alt="Карта тривог" onerror="fallbackMap()">
            <div class="info-bar">
                <div>
                    <span class="status-dot"></span>Онлайн
                </div>
                <button class="btn-refresh" onclick="updateMap()">Оновити карту</button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="radar-panel">
            <div class="radar-title">🚀 Моніторинг загроз</div>
            <div class="radar-list">
                Система моніторингу повітряного простору працює в режимі оновлення.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
        KCL2 Vibes & Daily
    </footer>

    <script>
        const sources = [
            "https://ubstatic.com/map/map.png",
            "https://alerts.in.ua/map.png"
        ];
        let currentSource = 0;

        function updateMap() {
            const img = document.getElementById('alertMap');
            img.src = sources[currentSource] + "?t=" + new Date().getTime();
        }

        function fallbackMap() {
            currentSource = (currentSource + 1) % sources.length;
            updateMap();
        }

        setInterval(updateMap, 30000);
    </script>

</body>
</html>
